MTD	mzTab-version	2.1.0-M
MTD	mzTab-ID	ST001225_AN002038
MTD	mzTab-profile	M+S
MTD	title	Targeted metabolomics
MTD	description	We propose to evaluate microbial and metabolic profiles in baseline and endpoint colonic mucosal, fecal, and serum samples from human patients at risk for CRC and enrolled in a 90-day phase I clinical trial. Patients will receive daily supplementation with calcium alone, a calcium-rich multimineral (Aquamin?), or placebo (maltodextrin) (n=10 per group). We hypothesize that dietary supplementation will correlate with CRC-protective metabolic profiles and that multimineral supplementation will generate more favorable profiles than calcium supplementation alone.
